{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21194","headline":"韦氏馆与周隐客杜归和泛舟 · 元稹","name":"韦氏馆与周隐客杜归和泛舟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天色低澹澹，池光漫油油。\n轻舟闲缴绕，不远池上楼。\n时物欣外奖，真元随内修。\n神恬津藏满，气委支节柔。\n衆处岂自异，旷怀谁我俦。\n风车笼野马，八荒安足游。\n开颜陆浑杜，握手灵都周。\n持君宝珠赠，顶戴头上头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21194.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21194","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}